use and in the surrounding area.\n\nA private storage room in the basement offers extra space for your belongings, adding to your convenience.\n\nFeatures you'll love:\n\n🌿 Private balcony – Perfect for your morning coffee or a relaxing evening outdoors\n🚗 Dedicated parking space – Plus free public parking options nearby\n🍳 Fully equipped kitchen – Includes a dishwasher for your convenience\n🧺 Washing machine & dryer – Everything you need for easy laundry care\n🚿 Modern bathroom – Featuring both a rain shower and a bathtub for ultimate relaxation\n💻 Home office room – A dedicated space for focused work\n📦 Basement storage compartment – Extra room for seasonal items or personal storage\n✅ Anmeldung is possible – Your home can be your official address \n\nWhether you're here for business or to enjoy Berlin’s rich cultural life, this apartment offers comfort, convenience, and tranquility in equal measure.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"3"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"yes"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"tenantStatus":{"value":"working professionals only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"70"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"